Given $n$ i.i.d training samples $\{x_i\}_{i=1}^n$ from state space $\mathcal{S} = [M]^d$, we train the model by minimizing empirical  loss $\widehat{\mathcal{L}}^{i_0}_{\rm CDFM}$ following \eqref{eqn:cdfm_loss_empirical}.
Then for large enough $n$ we have: 
\begin{align*}
    \underset{\{x_i\}_{i=1}^n}{{\mathbb{E}}}[\mathcal{R}^{i_0}(\widehat{\Theta}^{i_0})] \lesssim M^{13d_0}n^{-\frac{1}{5Md_0}}(\log n)^{\frac{1}{5Md_0}},
\end{align*}
Here we set transformer feature dimension $d_0>25$ for simplicity.

