For any coordinate $i_0\in[d]$, let $\widehat{u}^{i_0}_\theta$  be the $i$-th velocity estimator trained by minimizing empirical loss $\widehat{\mathcal{L}}^{i_0}_{\rm CDFM}$ following \eqref{eqn:cdfm_loss_empirical}.
