If $X\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times L}$ satisfies $\|X\|\le B_X$, then $f_{\mathcal{T}}$ is Lipschitz continuous w.r.t. the Frobenius norm $\|\cdot\|_F$ with Lipschitz constant
